  "notes": "USAGE:\nA practical vocabulary word for daily life in Japan, especially during winter when indoor heating creates large temperature differences between the warm interior and cold exterior. {結露|けつろ} on windows is a common household concern because it can lead to mold growth.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {結露|けつろ}{対策|たいさく}: condensation prevention measures\n- {結露|けつろ}を{防|ふせ}ぐ: to prevent condensation\n- {結露|けつろ}が{発生|はっせい}する: condensation forms\n- {結露|けつろ}を{拭|ふ}き{取|と}る: to wipe away condensation\n- {窓|まど}の{結露|けつろ}: window condensation",
